2084 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Southern Seas Marine\054 based at Gold Coast City Marina\054 is a trusted distributor of quality marine products for boat owners\054 marine businesses\054 and recreational and commercial operators across Australia\056 Its portfolio includes Restube personal flotation devices\054 Lofrans anchor windlasses\054 MaxPower bow and stern thrusters\054 Actisense marine electronics\054 Kicker Marine audio systems\054 Fischer Panda marine generators\054 Katadyne watermakers and portable desalination systems\054 bronze fittings\054 and SmartPlug shore power connectors\056 The broad range covers safety equipment\054 propulsion and power systems\054 navigation and electronics\054 fresh water solutions\054 and essential marine hardware\056 An Australia\055wide dealer network provides genuine products\054 expert advice and reliable after\055sales support\056 Southern Seas Marine works closely with dealers to maintain stock\054 market knowledge\054 service capability\054 quality and consistent pricing while continuing to grow its brand portfolio and dealer footprint\056)
