2132 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Gold Coast is one of Australia\031s most established marine industry centres\054 home to more than 500 marine businesses spanning advanced manufacturing\054 refit and repair\054 marine technology\054 design\054 professional services\054 and superyacht support\056 This mature and highly connected ecosystem has earned a global reputation for innovation\054 capability\054 and quality\056\nThe businesses featured in this delegation represent the depth and diversity of the Gold Coast marine sector and are attending Metstrade 2026 to build international partnerships\054 explore new commercial opportunities\054 and strengthen connections across the global marine industry\056 We invite you to connect with our delegation and discover how the Gold Coast\031s world\055class expertise\054 infrastructure\054 and collaborative industry network can support your business and investment objectives\056)
